  "slug": "creamed-broccoli-and-mushroom-soup",
  "name": "Creamed Broccoli and Mushroom Soup",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "This is a delicious and easy recipe that's great on cold winter days. I always use fresh ingredients when possible but you can use frozen or canned items if you wish.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large pot, mix the water, broccoli, mushrooms, and butter. Bring to a boil, reduce heat to low, and simmer 5 minutes, until broccoli is tender. Mix in milk powder, soup, hot sauce, pepper, and garlic powder. Continue cooking, stirring frequently, until heated through."
    }
  ],
